@startuml
!include ../style.puml
' diagram-id: VIEW-UC-02
' classification: TARGET
' Mapping: signup/recovery/profile = UC-01; contexts/starting choices support UC-01/02/04.
' Path = UC-04; lesson = UC-06; vocabulary = UC-07; level-up = UC-05; progress = UC-08.
' Login is presentation-only, within UC-01; no new canonical UC.
' Authority: ADR-031–036. Max two ACTIVE contexts; PAUSED retains state and global SRS.
' Placement recommends starting level only; self-report/default create no assessment result.
' Lesson: N core exercises; K first-wrong items retry once; performance denominator N+K.
' Completion independent of correctness; latest completed performance is primary.
' Core vocabulary auto-enrolls after completion; optional vocabulary is learner-added.
' SRS identity User+Vocabulary; Policy B 1,3,7,14,30 days then recurring 30 days.
' ADR-041: no learner due-list browsing; the system selects questions for ordinary/dedicated sessions.
' SRS is outside scored immutable Placement/Level-up Assessment Versions.
' Unavailable requirements excluded from progress; withdrawal/replacement preserve history.
' Reassessment/reminder deferred and excluded from active view.
left to right direction
title Sơ đồ Use Case của Học viên

actor "Học viên" as Learner
rectangle "HỆ THỐNG HỌC NGOẠI NGỮ LINGORA" {
  package "Tài khoản" {
    usecase "Đăng ký tài khoản" as Signup
    usecase "Khôi phục mật khẩu" as Recovery
    usecase "Quản lý hồ sơ cá nhân" as Profile
    usecase "Đăng nhập / Xác thực" as Login
  }
  package "Học tập" {
    usecase "Quản lý ngữ cảnh học" as Context
    usecase "Chọn điểm bắt đầu học" as Start
    usecase "Khám phá lộ trình học" as Path
    usecase "Học bài và luyện tập" as Lesson
    usecase "Học từ vựng và ôn tập" as SRS
    usecase "Kiểm tra lên cấp" as LevelUp
    usecase "Xem tiến độ và chuỗi ngày học" as Progress
  }
}
Learner -- Signup
Learner -- Recovery
Learner -- Profile
Learner -- Login
Learner -- Context
Learner -- Start
Learner -- Path
Learner -- Lesson
Learner -- SRS
Learner -- LevelUp
Learner -- Progress

Profile ..> Login : <<include>>
Context ..> Login : <<include>>
Start ..> Login : <<include>>
Path ..> Login : <<include>>
Lesson ..> Login : <<include>>
SRS ..> Login : <<include>>
LevelUp ..> Login : <<include>>
Progress ..> Login : <<include>>
@enduml
